  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine cottage cheese, crunchy greek cheese, and kicked feta.",
    "Stir in beaten eggs, salt, and black pepper until well combined.",
    "Pour the mixture into a greased 9-inch pie plate.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the edges are golden brown.",
    "Remove from oven and top with saganaki slices.",
    "Return to oven and bake for an additional 2-3 minutes or until cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from oven and garnish with chopped parsley.",
